## Competitive and replayable modes

25. **Puzzle Rush** — **Medium**
    Solve as many increasingly difficult puzzles as possible in three minutes.

26. **Puzzle Streak with Saving Throws** — **Medium**
    Continue until defeated, but earn a limited “saving throw” by maintaining high accuracy or completing daily quests.

27. **Family Puzzle Duel** — **Medium**
    Josh and Sylvie take turns solving the same child-friendly positions on one device. No public chat or strangers required.

