```
The mode alternates turns on the same device. Each person receives a suitable difficulty band, meaning Josh and Sylvie can compete fairly without receiving identical puzzles.

Add cooperative mode where both contribute to one shared family score.

### 28. Variant Arcade
Build this last because your normal chess rules engine may not support every variant.

Start with variants that are close to standard chess:

1. King of the Hill.
2. Three-check.
3. Chess960.
4. Custom challenge positions.

Create a rules adapter:

```
interface ChessRulesAdapter {
  legalMoves(): Move[];
  makeMove(move: Move): void;
  isGameOver(): boolean;
  getResult(): GameResult | null;
}
```
Standard chess and each variant implement that interface. Do not bury variant rules directly inside `ChessBoard.tsx`.

### 29. Private family multiplayer
Create private rooms with unguessable invitation tokens:

