```
The server must validate every move before writing it to the room.

Use Supabase Realtime to broadcast:

- Move accepted.
- Opponent joined.
- Resignation.
- Draw offer.
- Rematch.

Start with private invitation links only. Avoid public chat, matchmaking and stranger interaction.

### 30. Opening Spellbook
Break openings into small position cards rather than teaching enormous move trees.

```
opening_cards
